    account (decision 3 in specs/06-account.md). They are already logged
    out, so the header shows the logged-out links. %>

<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Account deleted' }) %>

<h1>Your account has been deleted.</h1>
<p>Your profile, connection requests, conversations and photo have been removed. Thank you for trying Bootcamp Connect.</p>
<p><a href="/login">Back to the login page</a></p>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
